      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:52927/vmware-workstation-pro-15-parte-01-instalacao/images/VMware-Workstation-Pro-15-Released-with-New-Features.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;725&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;376&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:52927/vmware-workstation-pro-15-parte-01-instalacao/images/VMware-Workstation-Pro-15-Released-with-New-Features.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:52927/vmware-workstation-pro-15-parte-01-instalacao/images/VMware-Workstation-Pro-15-Released-with-New-Features.png 800w, http://localhost:52927/vmware-workstation-pro-15-parte-01-instalacao/images/VMware-Workstation-Pro-15-Released-with-New-Features.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:52927/vmware-workstation-pro-15-parte-01-instalacao/images/VMware-Workstation-Pro-15-Released-with-New-Features.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Faz algum tempo que venho querendo falar um pouco sobre o VMware Workstation Pro.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Apesar do mesmo ser uma ferramenta voltada para desktop, o mesmo possui várias funcionalidades que são pouco exploradas entre seus usuários, como por exemplo a possibilidade de criptografar o disco, acesso remoto, execução de scripts, gerenciamento via console e etc.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
